OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment appeal over Sean Brown
OL,4,Amurder inquiry ruling to be heard
OL,5,
OL,6,FA government appeal against a ruling
OL,7,Fordering a public inquiry into the
OL,8,Fmurder of Gaelic Athletic Association
OL,9,F(GAA) official Sean Brown is being
OL,10,Fheard at the UK Supreme Court on
OL,11,FTuesday.
OL,13,FMr Brown, 61, was abducted in Bellaghy,
OL,14,FCounty Londonderry, and shot by the
OL,15,FLoyalist Volunteer Force (LVF) in 1997.
OL,17,FIntelligence material has since linked
OL,18,Fstate agents to his murder.
OL,20,FThe hearing in London is scheduled to
OL,21,Flast one day, with a judgment coming at
OL,22,Fa future point in time.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
